@prefix ex: <https://example.org/class-recognition/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
ex:C a owl:Class .
ex:R a owl:Restriction; owl:onProperty ex:p; owl:someValuesFrom ex:Filler .
ex:C owl:equivalentClass ex:R .
ex:x ex:p ex:value . ex:value a ex:Filler .
